5,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm Rin! This game looks so exciting, like a real mystery adventure! Let's find the werewolf super fast, okay? I bet I can spot them right away! Who wants to start?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us keep a level head; haste often leads to mistakes. I believe we should observe each other's behavior carefully before jumping to any conclusions.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I'm Daisuke. I agree with George... I think we should be careful. I'm not very good at this, so I'll probably just... listen to what you all think.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us be kind to one another as we search for the truth. I believe George is right; a gentle, careful approach is best.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone, I'm Midori. It's nice to meet you all! I agree with George and Shizue; let's try to maintain a harmonious atmosphere while we carefully observe each other. I'm looking forward to playing with you!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Everyone is being so slow! If we just wait and watch, the werewolf will just keep hiding! @George, @Shizue, @Midori, why are you all agreeing so much? It's boring! Let's start guessing things already!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is admirable, but guessing without evidence is merely gambling. Logic dictates that we first establish a baseline of behavior. Let us not mistake silence for inaction; observation is a form of action.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think George is right. Guessing might just lead to mistakes... and I don't want to accidentally blame someone who is innocent. Sorry, Rin, but I'm too nervous to just start guessing.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, your energy is quite refreshing, dear. But please, do not be too impatient. We are all friends here, and it is better to be sure than to be hasty. Let us just listen to one another for now.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I understand you're excited, but let's try to be patient. If we rush, we might hurt someone's feelings or make a mistake. Let's value the trust we build together first. I'm sure we'll find the truth!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Hmph! You're all just too cautious! If we're too ""harmonious,"" the werewolf will just laugh at us! I'm going to keep my eyes wide open and find a clue that none of you see! Who's the most suspicious so far?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"@Rin, it is far too early to label anyone as suspicious. Such accusations without a foundation of logic only create unnecessary discord. Let us simply continue our introductions and observe.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't think I can say who is suspicious yet. Everyone seems... nice. I'll just keep watching and try to help however I can. Sorry...,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is quite alright, Daisuke. There is no need to apologize for being thoughtful. Let us all simply breathe and be present. I am sure the truth will reveal itself in time if we remain patient.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shizue. Let's not rush into accusations. By staying calm and supportive of one another, we can create a space where the truth becomes easier to see. I'm here to support everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Fine! I'll be the one to find the bad guy while you all are just ""breathing""! I'm super ready for tomorrow! Let's see who starts acting weird once the game really begins! Bye-bye for now!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,A sensible conclusion for today. Let us all reflect on these initial interactions. I shall be watching closely to see whose words align with their actions tomorrow. Good night to you all.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Good night... I hope I can be useful tomorrow. I'll try my best to pay attention to everything. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Good night, everyone. Sleep peacefully and dream sweet dreams. I shall be praying for our safety and for the truth to guide us tomorrow. I look forward to seeing you all again in the morning.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone! Let's all get some good rest so we can start tomorrow with clear minds. I'm looking forward to seeing how we all work together. Sweet dreams!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
