31,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Wake up, everyone! It's Day 1! Did anyone have a spooky dream? @George, you're the ""logic guy,"" so tell us something! Does anyone feel suspicious already? I'm ready to find the werewolf right now!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"@Rin, your energy is consistent, but we must remain objective. We have no concrete evidence yet. I suggest we first see if anyone has information to share, such as the Seer, before we speculate.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... I agree with George. If the Seer knows something, it would be better to hear it first... right? I'm still a bit nervous, so I'll trust George's way of doing things.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a lovely morning, isn't it? @George, you are very sensible. I believe it is important that we share what we know honestly, but we must also be careful not to put ourselves in danger too soon.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. I agree with George and Daisuke; if the Seer has any information, it would be a great help. Let's listen to each other carefully and stay calm.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Ugh, you're all still being so slow! @George, you're just stalling! If the Seer isn't speaking up, maybe they're the werewolf trying to trick us! Let's just pick someone and vote! Who's it gonna be?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"@Rin, your desire for speed is once again overriding your reason. Voting without a target based on evidence is not a strategy; it is a gamble that risks executing an innocent villager. We must be more methodical than that.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin... please don't be so angry. I'm scared that if we just pick someone randomly, we'll make a terrible mistake. I... I think we should keep listening to George. He seems to have a plan.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, dear, please calm your heart. Anger can cloud our vision, and we must be clear-headed to protect one another. Let us give everyone a moment to think and speak their truth.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I know you're eager to move forward, but let's not let frustration lead us to a mistake. Trusting each other is just as important as finding the werewolf. Let's give everyone a chance to share their thoughts first.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're always talking about ""methodical"" things, but it's just a way to hide! @Daisuke is too scared to think for himself! I bet the werewolf is someone who's acting way too nice! Who's it? I'm voting soon!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"@Rin, your accusations are becoming erratic. Attacking those who are calm or hesitant is not a logical path to the truth. If you wish to vote, please provide a reason based on fact, not just a feeling.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin... I'm not just scared... I just don't want to hurt anyone. I'm trying to think, but it's hard when you're shouting. I... I still think George is being the most reasonable.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, please be gentle with Daisuke. He is only trying his best to be careful. While I understand your frustration, let us remember that kindness and patience are our strongest allies in finding the truth.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, please try to be a bit more patient with Daisuke. We all have different ways of processing things. Let's focus on finding clues together rather than attacking each other. Does anyone have any observations to share?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're just trying to make me look like the bad guy! I'm the only one actually trying to win! Since nobody's talking, I'm voting for the most ""perfect"" person! I've decided! I'm voting for George!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,"@Rin, your decision is based on a personal dislike of my demeanor rather than any evidence of guilt. To vote for me simply because I am ""perfect"" is an emotional reaction, not a logical deduction.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin... please don't do that. George hasn't done anything wrong, he's just trying to help us be careful. I... I can't agree with voting for him just because of how he talks. It doesn't feel right.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, please, let us not act in haste. George has only sought to protect us from a mistake. I feel it would be very sad to lose a friend based on a misunderstanding. Let us think together once more.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I'm really sad to see you make a decision based on frustration. George has been consistent and fair. Let's not let our emotions lead us to a mistake we can't undo. I can't support this vote.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
